<%!--
  Live layout for every signed-in page. Rendered inside the root layout, on
  both the dead and the connected render, so the chat widget below is part of
  the page from the first paint.

  The widget is sticky: live navigation between pages in the same live
  session keeps it, and its conversation, alive. The root layout's nav is
  outside any LiveView and does not re-render on live navigation; app.js keeps
  its current-page state in step.
--%>
{@inner_content}
<%= if ResidencySchedule.Assistant.Chat.enabled?() do %>
  {live_render(@socket, ResidencyScheduleWeb.ChatLive.Widget, id: "chat-widget", sticky: true)}
<% end %>
